# Pick random spatial file. Read all positions and fluxes. If 7 SNRs are present, read 7 random spectrum files and assign randomly. Add Cas A separately from DC4 simulations. 

# Spatial: Position given in galactic coordinates (l=longitude, b=latitude). Flux given in ph cm^-2 s^-1 keV^-1. Fluxes range from 1e-6 to 3.1e-4
# Popsyn generates 8 to 9 SNRs (5 known SNRs + 3 to 4 randomly distributed SNRs) 
# Spectra: Iterate over spectrum{i}.dat where i=1 to 48

DataChallenge.Source		    	SNR1
SNR1.ParticleType               	1
SNR1.Beam	                        FarFieldPointSource 0 0
SNR1.Orientation 	                Galactic Fixed {b} {l}
SNR1.Spectrum            	        File {spectrum.dat}
SNR1.Flux                      		{flux}

#...
# DataChallenge.Source			SNR2
#					Use random spectrum.dat

#...
#					SNRn
#					Use random spectrum.dat